# Keeps Docker build contexts (docker-compose.yaml's services build with `context: .`, the
# repo root) small and hermetic. Without this, COPY packages/common /app/packages/common in
# service Dockerfiles pulls in untracked build/, *.egg-info, and __pycache__/.pytest_cache
# alongside the .venv/.git directories that make up most of the repo's ~500MB on disk -- a
# stale packages/common/build/ could in principle get baked into the wheel instead of fresh
# source, depending on setuptools' staleness check.
.git
.venv
**/.venv
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
node_modules
.superpowers
